WEBVTT

00:05:58.802 --> 00:06:01.887
to the more complicated one
of question asking

00:06:01.911 --> 00:06:03.591
and question framing.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:06.919
Because in so doing, you open up
all kinds of new possibilities

00:06:06.943 --> 00:06:08.418
and new challenges.

00:06:08.442 --> 00:06:10.420
For me, right now,

00:06:10.444 --> 00:06:13.238
there are six big questions
that frame our approach

00:06:13.262 --> 00:06:16.318
for taking AI safely, sustainably
and responsibly to scale.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.216
Questions about autonomy,

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.077
agency, assurance,

00:06:20.101 --> 00:06:22.878
indicators, interfaces and intentionality.

00:06:24.284 --> 00:06:26.690
The first question we ask is a simple one.

00:06:27.038 --> 00:06:28.718
Is the system autonomous?

00:06:29.284 --> 00:06:31.402
Think back to that lift on Bligh Street.